# Netlify redirects
# The free reactivation pilot was replaced by The First 10 (paid entry offer,
# guaranteed outcome). Anything already shared pointing at /pilot lands on the
# live offer instead of the retired page.
#
# The trailing "!" is required: without it Netlify serves the existing
# pilot.html and ignores the rule. The file is kept on disk (and in git) but is
# unreachable while these rules are in place.
/pilot        /first-10   301!
/pilot.html   /first-10   301!

# The Follow-Up Gap Blueprint (free guide for coaching businesses, companion to
# the "wipe out half of coaching businesses" video) is hosted on Vercel. Short
# link for the YouTube description and DMs. 302 on purpose: if the page moves
# onto this domain later, the redirect can change without browsers caching it.
/blueprint    https://follow-up-gap-blueprint.vercel.app   302
